! GFM audit settlement (WPG.17): a PVSystem in grid-forming inverter mode
! (ControlMode=GFM) BLACK-STARTING an ISLANDED section in DYNAMICS mode — the
! PVSystem twin of gfm_dynamics.dss (the auditors flagged that the PV GFM
! dynamics path had only a last-sample unit pin, no full-trajectory live gate).
!
! Topology: sourcebus --feeder--> mainbus --sw1(OPEN)--> islbus. Opening sw1
! islands {islbus, pvbus}; the only source left is the GFM PVSystem (balanced
! internal voltage source scaled by its integrated filter current it[0] behind
! CalcGFMYprim), stepped up 0.48->4.16 kV by tpv, forming the island voltage.
!
! Dynamics-mode PV GFM machinery exercised (PVsystem.pas / InvDynamics.pas):
!   InitStateVars GFM it:=0 seed (PVsystem.pas:2246-2249), IntegrateStates GFM
!   droop using the OVERWRITTEN iMaxPPhase (:2305/:2324-2355 — unlike Storage,
!   which keeps IMaxPhase local), DoDynamicMode GFM injection (:1870-1876).
!
! SafeVoltage=0 IS MANDATORY (same as the Storage deck): the default MinVS
! safe-mode threshold blocks a black start from 0 V.
!
! FEATURE-SENSITIVITY (pinned oracle dss-python 0.15.7, 60x 1ms steps):
!   WITH   ControlMode=GFM + SafeVoltage=0: island BLACK-STARTS, islbus
!          ~0.977 pu after 60 steps, PV supplies the island load.
!   WITHOUT ControlMode=GFM (plain GFL): the islanded inverter cannot form
!          voltage -> dynamics solve NON-CONVERGENT (NaN node V) — a total
!          divergence. (Validation fingerprints recorded in the manifest note.)
Clear
New Circuit.pv_gfm_dyn basekv=4.16 phases=3 bus1=sourcebus
New Line.feeder bus1=sourcebus bus2=mainbus phases=3 r1=0.3 x1=0.6 c1=0 length=1 units=km
New Line.sw1 bus1=mainbus bus2=islbus phases=3 switch=yes
New Transformer.tpv phases=3 windings=2 buses=(pvbus islbus) conns=(delta wye) kvs=(0.48 4.16) kvas=(1000 1000) XHL=0.5
New PVSystem.pv phases=3 conn=delta bus1=pvbus kV=0.48 kva=800 pmpp=800 irradiance=1 %R=50 %X=50 kP=0.3 KVDC=0.700 PITol=0.1 SafeVoltage=0 ControlMode=GFM
New Load.isl phases=3 bus1=islbus kV=4.16 kW=400 kvar=80 model=1
New Monitor.pvi element=PVSystem.pv terminal=1 mode=0
New Monitor.psv element=PVSystem.pv terminal=1 mode=3
Set voltagebases=[4.16 0.48]
Calcvoltagebases
open line.sw1 terminal=1
solve
Set mode=dynamics stepsize=0.001 number=60 maxiterations=30
